WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.930
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:08.200 --> 00:10.350
Wait!

3
00:13.920 --> 00:15.790
I can't wait.

4
00:15.790 --> 00:18.270
Since I'm your boyfriend,

5
00:18.270 --> 00:20.270
can I have my way with you?

6
00:28.480 --> 00:30.360
Hold on a second.

7
00:35.090 --> 00:37.460
Take off that jacket.

8
00:43.320 --> 00:47.650
Wear mine instead.

9
00:47.650 --> 00:49.070
Oh...

10
00:50.010 --> 00:51.730
Okay.

11
01:21.810 --> 01:23.470
Thanks.

12
01:27.290 --> 01:28.950
Uh...

13
01:33.090 --> 01:35.020
Sorry.

14
01:35.020 --> 01:36.620
Don't be.

15
01:36.620 --> 01:38.920
I'm not mad, but...

16
01:40.050 --> 01:42.780
We're not just friends, okay?

17
01:43.790 --> 01:46.510
We're boyfriends.

18
01:47.460 --> 01:50.120
I need you to know that.

19
01:51.040 --> 01:52.460
Okay.

20
02:02.990 --> 02:05.770
Huh? Why's the door locked?

21
02:11.230 --> 02:14.540
Watarai? It's our group's turn in the baths.

22
02:14.540 --> 02:16.460
My bad.

23
02:16.460 --> 02:19.510
Huh? Hioki?

24
02:20.490 --> 02:22.600
Everything okay?

25
02:23.330 --> 02:24.640
Yeah.

26
02:24.640 --> 02:27.360
I was just lending my jacket to him.

27
02:28.350 --> 02:31.900
Found you guys. What're you two doing?

28
02:31.900 --> 02:33.080
And why's Hioki here?

29
02:33.080 --> 02:34.910
Oh, uh...

30
02:35.760 --> 02:38.300
Hioki, your face is red. You okay?

31
02:38.300 --> 02:39.390
Yeah.

32
02:39.390 --> 02:41.630
By the way, Tsujitani was looking for you.

33
02:41.630 --> 02:43.130
Apparently, it's your group's turn to eat.

34
02:43.130 --> 02:44.940
Right, I have to go.

35
02:44.940 --> 02:46.110
I'll come back to return your jacket.

36
02:46.110 --> 02:49.720
Keep it, I'll be fine in a t-shirt.

37
02:50.840 --> 02:52.500
If you say so.

38
02:53.360 --> 02:55.180
Then...

39
02:55.180 --> 02:56.690
Yeah.

40
04:07.670 --> 04:09.300
What was that about? [Study Camp - 2]

41
04:09.300 --> 04:11.540
Something definitely happened in there.

42
04:11.540 --> 04:14.060
Nothing happened.

43
04:14.060 --> 04:16.030
It's just...

44
04:16.610 --> 04:19.940
What? Did Hioki screw up?

45
04:19.940 --> 04:23.690
No. It's not Hioki's fault.

46
04:24.650 --> 04:26.710
It's...

47
04:26.710 --> 04:28.430
It's me.

48
04:36.510 --> 04:43.820
I think I like Hioki way more than he thinks I do.

49
04:54.160 --> 04:56.400
I'm beat.

50
04:57.460 --> 05:00.450
Now, we just sleep.

51
05:00.450 --> 05:03.150
Can't wait.

52
05:03.150 --> 05:04.930
Evening folks!

53
05:04.930 --> 05:07.600
- Sorry, we're taking Hioki. - You get me instead.

54
05:07.600 --> 05:10.000
- Huh? - Hioki?

55
05:10.000 --> 05:11.810
Hioki!

56
05:11.810 --> 05:13.520
Open sesame!

57
05:13.520 --> 05:15.490
Keep walking...

58
05:15.490 --> 05:16.560
And stop.

59
05:16.560 --> 05:20.680
Welcome!

60
05:20.680 --> 05:22.140
Watarai?

61
05:22.140 --> 05:25.090
I'm here, too.

62
05:25.090 --> 05:26.870
Huh? What's going on?

63
05:26.870 --> 05:30.210
I thought we could relive our school trip, and share a room tonight.

64
05:30.210 --> 05:34.210
I asked a teacher expecting a no, but they gave me the go ahead!

65
05:34.210 --> 05:36.440
- Seriously? - Yeah.

66
05:36.440 --> 05:38.560
This room was meant to accommodate five,

67
05:38.560 --> 05:42.220
so we asked to swap rooms, and the students here said yes.

68
05:42.220 --> 05:43.620
I told you, right?

69
05:43.620 --> 05:46.080
I'd figure something out.

70
05:49.940 --> 05:54.240
I'm the one that did the negotiating though.

71
05:54.240 --> 05:56.810
Only because I suggested we try.

72
05:56.810 --> 05:58.160
Oh?

73
05:58.160 --> 05:59.540
You wanna go?

74
05:59.540 --> 06:00.740
No fighting, please.

75
06:00.740 --> 06:02.430
- Come at me! - There!

76
06:02.430 --> 06:05.220
You struck first.

77
06:05.220 --> 06:07.140
Self-defense!

78
06:07.140 --> 06:10.000
- Hioki, help out! - Come on, Hioki!

79
06:39.520 --> 06:41.030
You grabbed your glasses?

80
06:41.030 --> 06:42.710
Yeah.

81
06:43.550 --> 06:45.210
Want a drink?

82
06:46.050 --> 06:47.500
You sure?

83
06:47.500 --> 06:49.080
Yeah.

84
06:51.900 --> 06:54.590
But no telling Watarai.

85
06:54.590 --> 06:57.940
He become a pain to deal with when it's about you.

86
06:57.940 --> 06:59.340
Go ahead.

87
07:03.980 --> 07:05.780
- Thanks. - No prob.

88
07:15.930 --> 07:18.170
Morisaki.

89
07:18.170 --> 07:19.850
Yeah?

90
07:19.850 --> 07:22.990
Does Watarai ever confide in you?

91
07:22.990 --> 07:24.050
About?

92
07:24.050 --> 07:26.770
His worries...

93
07:26.770 --> 07:28.690
or stuff about me, I guess?

94
07:30.890 --> 07:32.930
Well...

95
07:32.930 --> 07:36.170
He definitely seems more lonely now that you're in separate classes.

96
07:36.170 --> 07:37.920
What about you, Hioki?

97
07:37.920 --> 07:39.880
Huh?

98
07:39.880 --> 07:42.720
You don't feel lonely, separated from him?

99
07:43.710 --> 07:49.130
It's not that I don't feel lonely.

100
07:50.730 --> 07:53.280
This is just my speculation, but...

101
07:54.680 --> 07:59.420
I think Watarai wants you to rely on him more.

102
08:02.990 --> 08:04.520
You know,

103
08:04.520 --> 08:07.300
this brings back memories.

104
08:08.020 --> 08:09.650
It does.

105
08:09.650 --> 08:12.150
Our school trip was so fun.

106
08:12.150 --> 08:14.070
Pretty eventful, too.

107
08:15.250 --> 08:17.700
Remember when Hioki got lost?

108
08:17.700 --> 08:19.040
- The amusement park incident? - Yeah.

109
08:19.040 --> 08:21.660
Hioki, I bet you don't know this,

110
08:21.660 --> 08:25.680
but before you got lost, we actually fought with the girls.

111
08:25.680 --> 08:26.970
Oh, yeah.

112
08:26.970 --> 08:29.580
The girls got jealous of you.

113
08:29.580 --> 08:30.900
What?

114
08:30.900 --> 08:34.740
Watarai.

115
08:34.740 --> 08:36.730
What is it about Hioki you like?

116
08:38.840 --> 08:40.730
Everything.

117
08:40.730 --> 08:44.880
You said that about me?

118
08:44.880 --> 08:47.950
Well... yeah.

119
08:50.550 --> 08:55.700
There was also the glasses incident, and sunrise incident, too.

120
08:55.700 --> 08:57.470
What was the sunrise incident?

121
08:57.470 --> 08:58.840
Don't you remember?

122
08:58.840 --> 09:03.010
When we all were praising the sunrise...

123
09:03.010 --> 09:04.900
Oh, right.

124
09:04.900 --> 09:07.740
He got embarrassed, because his name means "sunrise".

125
09:07.740 --> 09:09.310
- Exactly! - Oh, right.

126
09:09.310 --> 09:10.550
I remember now.

127
09:10.550 --> 09:12.780
You don't need to remember.

128
09:12.780 --> 09:14.930
Aw, why not? You were super cute.

129
09:14.930 --> 09:16.960
- Right? - Yeah.

130
09:16.960 --> 09:19.180
You were adorable.

131
09:21.660 --> 09:25.460
Remember the haunted house?

132
09:25.460 --> 09:26.820
The mummy incident?

133
09:26.820 --> 09:28.200
- Yeah, that. - Right, the mummy incident!

134
09:28.200 --> 09:30.460
That one was hilarious.

135
09:30.460 --> 09:31.420
Hioki mixed up

136
09:31.420 --> 09:34.100
- the mummy's hand with Watarai's, right? - Yeah.

137
09:34.100 --> 09:36.690
He made such a high-pitched scream.

138
09:36.690 --> 09:38.870
I could never forget it.

139
09:38.870 --> 09:40.560
You weren't any better, Hotta.

140
09:40.560 --> 09:41.930
Yeah, you were the real scaredy-cat.

141
09:41.930 --> 09:44.840
[Kameyama Hot Spring Hotel]

142
10:07.250 --> 10:09.190
He's fast asleep, isn't he?

143
10:10.410 --> 10:11.830
You were awake?

144
10:11.830 --> 10:13.230
Yeah.

145
10:14.000 --> 10:18.030
I think being with you put him at ease.

146
10:21.950 --> 10:24.980
You were right, Nakasato.

147
10:24.980 --> 10:26.380
Huh?

148
10:27.240 --> 10:28.850
I...

149
10:32.040 --> 10:37.760
I had no idea Watarai was so worried.

150
10:40.940 --> 10:42.840
I get it.

151
10:42.840 --> 10:44.990
I was in your shoes before.

152
10:45.650 --> 10:46.780
Huh?

153
10:46.780 --> 10:51.470
Remember the ex-girlfriend I mentioned during our school trip?

154
10:51.470 --> 10:55.600
Nakasato had been dating his childhood friend, but...

155
10:55.600 --> 10:57.890
She got snatched away.

156
10:57.890 --> 11:00.570
By her college tutor.

157
11:01.490 --> 11:03.730
Oh, her.

158
11:03.730 --> 11:06.910
I can't forgive her for cheating on me.

159
11:08.430 --> 11:10.940
But I do think I'm partially to blame.

160
11:13.420 --> 11:18.310
If we actually told each other about our worries,

161
11:18.310 --> 11:24.370
maybe things would have been different now.

162
11:28.660 --> 11:33.530
Couples aren't mind readers, you know?

163
11:41.020 --> 11:43.510
Yikes! Good night.

164
11:43.510 --> 11:45.870
Night.

165
11:45.870 --> 11:47.840
Hioki...

166
12:17.000 --> 12:18.720
Watarai.

167
12:19.850 --> 12:21.430
Watarai.

168
12:24.490 --> 12:26.510
Watarai, wake up.

169
12:30.280 --> 12:32.360
- Hioki? - Shh!

170
12:39.470 --> 12:42.460
What's up? Can't sleep?

171
12:42.460 --> 12:44.210
No.

172
12:44.210 --> 12:46.240
But, well...

173
12:47.460 --> 12:51.810
There's something I want to do before everyone else is up.

174
12:52.770 --> 12:54.220
Huh?

175
13:07.050 --> 13:09.110
Here.

176
13:09.110 --> 13:12.440
Let's eat breakfast together.

177
13:12.440 --> 13:13.520
Huh?

178
13:13.520 --> 13:16.750
You mentioned it before coming here, right?

179
13:16.750 --> 13:21.570
I can't wait. Sitting on the bus together, eating together,

180
13:22.420 --> 13:25.020
bathing together...

181
13:25.020 --> 13:28.420
We couldn't do the bath or bus part,

182
13:28.420 --> 13:31.590
so I thought we could at least do the meal part.

183
13:34.690 --> 13:37.040
You remembered?

184
13:37.040 --> 13:38.040
Yeah.

185
13:38.040 --> 13:42.640
I am your boyfriend, more or less.

186
13:43.590 --> 13:46.220
Not "more or less".

187
13:46.220 --> 13:48.020
You are my boyfriend.

188
13:48.020 --> 13:49.010
Right.

189
13:49.010 --> 13:51.110
But, you know.

190
13:51.110 --> 13:55.020
This is my first relationship,

191
13:55.020 --> 13:59.310
and I am a rookie at romance.

192
13:59.310 --> 14:00.860
So...

193
14:01.670 --> 14:05.300
I feel like I haven't made myself clear.

194
14:06.740 --> 14:08.310
Watarai.

195
14:09.700 --> 14:13.060
I like you more than you think I do.

196
14:14.850 --> 14:16.210
Now that we're third-years,

197
14:16.210 --> 14:19.950
I do feel lonely without you in the classroom.

198
14:19.950 --> 14:21.940
I want our breaks to last longer.

199
14:21.940 --> 14:26.340
If I didn't have practice, we'd have more time together.

200
14:27.090 --> 14:31.580
Really, that's all I think about.

201
14:33.430 --> 14:35.010
Anyway...

202
14:36.770 --> 14:40.940
Normally, I'm too embarrassed to say this, but...

203
14:44.170 --> 14:46.960
I love you, Watarai.

204
14:55.030 --> 14:57.910
- Hey... - Let me.

205
14:58.730 --> 15:00.710
I'm way too happy right now.

206
15:04.080 --> 15:07.090
Someone might see us.

207
15:08.820 --> 15:10.620
Let's do this instead.

208
15:12.060 --> 15:13.550
Okay.

209
15:34.610 --> 15:36.960
- Watch the step. - Thanks.

210
15:40.060 --> 15:42.160
The sunrise is beautiful.

211
15:44.310 --> 15:45.970
Y-Yeah.

212
15:47.480 --> 15:51.560
Sorry. Mentioning a sunrise embarrasses you, right?

213
15:51.560 --> 15:53.210
No, it's fine.

214
15:53.210 --> 15:58.110
The word "sunrise" doesn't normally bother me.

215
15:58.110 --> 15:59.900
Oh, okay.

216
16:01.340 --> 16:02.960
In that case.

217
16:06.690 --> 16:10.290
I love you too, Asahi.

218
16:15.030 --> 16:16.780
No, I...

219
16:16.780 --> 16:21.600
I'm not immune to that "sunrise" yet.

220
16:21.600 --> 16:23.750
Aw, come on.

221
16:23.750 --> 16:27.250
And how can you be immune to a word?

222
16:29.280 --> 16:31.410
Anyway, let's eat.

223
16:31.410 --> 16:32.810
Yeah.

224
16:34.670 --> 16:36.920
- Bon appétit. - Bon appétit.

225
16:44.380 --> 16:46.120
Yum.

226
16:47.130 --> 16:49.940
How much longer will you be doing badminton?

227
16:49.940 --> 16:52.330
Once this month's match is over, I'll be done with it.

228
16:52.330 --> 16:57.080
With that, our study camp came to a close.

229
16:57.080 --> 16:58.720
Hioki.

230
16:59.840 --> 17:02.320
- Let's walk home together. - Okay.

231
17:03.370 --> 17:05.320
Thanks.

232
17:12.770 --> 17:15.270
And now...

233
17:15.270 --> 17:17.850
The day I've been waiting for.

234
17:20.590 --> 17:21.820
Hioki!

235
17:21.820 --> 17:24.890
A date with Watarai.

236
17:24.890 --> 17:26.920
- And... - Did I keep you waiting?

237
17:26.920 --> 17:29.100
No, I just got here myself.

238
17:30.220 --> 17:31.670
Ta-da.

239
17:31.670 --> 17:32.940
Huh?

240
17:32.940 --> 17:36.010
Happy birthday.

241
17:36.010 --> 17:38.550
My birthday.

242
17:38.550 --> 17:41.200
Thanks. You remembered?

243
17:41.200 --> 17:44.730
Of course. I'm your boyfriend after all.

244
17:47.480 --> 17:50.380
But it's extra baggage, so I'll hold onto it.

245
17:50.380 --> 17:51.580
No, I'll hold it.

246
17:51.580 --> 17:53.920
Just let me. Come on.

247
17:53.920 --> 17:57.890
Let's do everything you want to do today.

248
18:00.390 --> 18:03.040
I haven't been to a zoo in forever.

249
18:03.040 --> 18:04.190
Same.

250
18:04.190 --> 18:06.390
What do you want to see?

251
18:17.250 --> 18:19.960
- It's coming closer! - Woah, it's huge.

252
18:19.960 --> 18:21.790
It's gonna eat.

253
18:21.790 --> 18:24.200
That neck is so long.

254
18:24.200 --> 18:26.110
Impressive.

255
18:26.110 --> 18:28.700
Say cheese.

256
18:31.330 --> 18:32.830
- Woah! - They're chowing down.

257
18:32.830 --> 18:34.700
- Eat up. - Is that good?

258
18:34.700 --> 18:37.770
- Cute! - Why me?

259
18:37.770 --> 18:41.140
Because you're both cute.

260
18:41.140 --> 18:42.840
- Cute. - Adorable!

261
18:42.840 --> 18:45.850
They're all looking at us.

262
18:45.850 --> 18:47.290
Try the giraffe.

263
18:47.290 --> 18:49.050
- How do I look? - Cute.

264
18:49.050 --> 18:51.040
- Roar! - Very nice.

265
18:51.040 --> 18:53.170
What? That's so cute!

266
18:53.170 --> 18:55.010
Aw, it looks just like you!

267
18:55.010 --> 18:56.160
Does it?

268
18:56.160 --> 18:57.950
Yeah.

269
19:03.330 --> 19:06.690
Cute, but so are you.

270
19:08.620 --> 19:10.940
- Bon appétit. - Bon appétit.

271
19:15.640 --> 19:18.560
- That's good. - You have cream on your cheek.

272
19:24.750 --> 19:26.810
There.

273
19:26.810 --> 19:28.420
Thanks.

274
19:33.870 --> 19:35.750
- Hioki. - Huh?

275
19:35.750 --> 19:39.650
I know I'm repeating myself, but happy birthday.

276
19:42.430 --> 19:44.400
Thank you.

277
19:44.400 --> 19:46.660
- Two gifts? - Yeah.

278
19:46.660 --> 19:50.190
- Why? - One for this year, and one for last year.

279
19:50.190 --> 19:54.920
Since we weren't great friends back at the time.

280
19:56.600 --> 20:00.140
Hair oil, and a belt?

281
20:00.140 --> 20:02.320
I can wear both to school. Can I open them?

282
20:02.320 --> 20:04.170
Sure, go ahead.

283
20:09.340 --> 20:14.440
Personally, I'd like it if you wore them every day.

284
20:14.440 --> 20:17.370
Then I guess I have to, huh?

285
20:17.370 --> 20:19.300
Yeah.

286
20:19.300 --> 20:21.000
Thanks again.

287
20:21.000 --> 20:22.080
Wow...

288
20:22.080 --> 20:24.600
Do you think you'll like the scent?

289
20:27.020 --> 20:29.910
Yeah, I like it.

290
20:34.500 --> 20:36.240
I like it, too.

291
20:42.680 --> 20:44.300
Hioki.

292
20:46.380 --> 20:48.860
Take good care of me

293
20:48.860 --> 20:50.690
as your boyfriend, okay?

294
20:54.560 --> 20:57.580
Of course.

295
20:57.580 --> 20:59.880
Take care of me, too.

296
20:59.880 --> 21:02.340
Of course.

297
21:08.540 --> 21:10.780
- Thanks. - Sure thing.

298
21:10.780 --> 21:13.250
- I'm glad you like it. - The belt is cute, too.

299
21:13.250 --> 21:15.740
I thought you'd look great in it.

300
21:15.740 --> 21:17.500
Thanks.

301
21:18.210 --> 21:21.730
My first day as an 18 year old.

302
21:21.730 --> 21:25.420
The first birthday I spent with my significant other,

303
21:25.420 --> 21:29.460
was far better than I ever expected.

304
21:54.320 --> 21:56.840
[Hioki: Thanks for today. I had lots of fun.]

305
21:56.840 --> 21:59.230
[Love you.]

306
22:05.150 --> 22:06.880
But at the time...

307
22:08.810 --> 22:11.980
I didn't even consider the fact.

308
22:11.980 --> 22:14.890
Huh? Tsukasa?

309
22:20.150 --> 22:21.910
That for Watarai...

310
22:21.910 --> 22:24.450
[Love you, too.] [Let's stay together forever, okay?]

311
22:29.260 --> 22:34.520
this wasn't his first relationship.

312
22:40.710 --> 22:42.660
Suzu?

313
22:51.120 --> 22:52.270
Watarai? [Meeting in secret with his ex?]

314
22:52.270 --> 22:53.580
For real?

315
22:53.580 --> 22:56.740
What sort of love life has Watarai led until now?

316
22:56.740 --> 23:01.180
Friend or not, I'd never forgive a cheater.

317
23:01.180 --> 23:03.450
I need to tell you something.

318
23:03.450 --> 23:04.840
Am I about to get rejected?

319
23:04.840 --> 23:06.890
Vroom!

320
23:06.890 --> 23:08.150
Hey, stop!

321
23:08.150 --> 23:10.350
Tsujitani.
